        <mxCell id="e-13-label" value="AWS PrivateLink" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];labelBackgroundColor=none;fontSize=11;fontColor=#545B64;fontFamily=Helvetica;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="e-13"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" y="0" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="28" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="7" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1326" y="478" width="28" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-bg" style="verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;shape=mxgraph.basic.rect;fillColor2=none;strokeWidth=1;size=20;indent=5;fillColor=light-dark(#EDF3FF,#305363);strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1680" y="30" width="620" height="712" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-container" connectable="0" style="group" value="" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="55" width="580" height="672" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="128" width="580" x="0" y="0" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="1" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;AWS WAF at the edge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;The client sends a JSON-RPC POST with a Bearer token. The CloudFront-scope web ACL runs before anything else: IP reputation, rate limits per IP, per initialize and per tool, Bot Control labels, body size, protocol version, tool allowlist, and SSRF, destructive SQL, SQLi and XSS in tool arguments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend"><mxGeometry height="128" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="74" width="580" x="0" y="128" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="2" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;CloudFront distribution&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Serves MCP at /mcp with caching disabled and caches /.well-known/*. TLS ends at the edge location; connections to the origin are reused.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry height="74" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="92" width="580" x="0" y="202" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="3" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;CloudFront Function (viewer request)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Decodes the JWT and returns 401 with resource_metadata for a missing, malformed or expired token, and sets x-jwt-claims and x-forwarded-host for the origin.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend"><mxGeometry height="92" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="92" width="580" x="0" y="294" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="4" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;VPC origin to a private ALB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;The ALB has only private IPs; its security group admits port 80 from the CloudFront origin-facing prefix list. CloudFront adds the secret x-origin-verify header on every origin request.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend"><mxGeometry height="92" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="92" width="580" x="0" y="386" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="5" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Regional AWS WAF on the ALB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Default block. Allows only requests with the secret header and an mcp/ scope in x-jwt-claims, and repeats the tool-argument rules, so a workload inside the VPC cannot skip the edge checks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend"><mxGeometry height="92" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="92" width="580" x="0" y="478" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="6" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fargate task verifies the token&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;The hello server checks the RS256 signature and the mcp/alb scope against the Cognito JWKS, serves the RFC 9728 protected-resource metadata, then answers the tools/call.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend"><mxGeometry height="92" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry height="92" width="580" x="0" y="570" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="7" vertex="1" parent="step-7-legend"><mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;No NAT gateway&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Isolated subnets. The task pulls its image from Amazon ECR, writes logs and fetches the JWKS through interface and gateway VPC endpoints over AWS PrivateLink.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-7-legend"><mxGeometry height="92" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
